# Render intermediates and outputs. The generators are the source of truth;
# every mp4 and every frame in here is reproducible by running a script.
#
# Without this file the folder is 952MB, almost all of it PNG frame sequences.
# The reels-20260818 folder has carried the same rule since it was created.
frames*/
.wrap/
.short01/
# img.py writes its camera-move frames here, about 2.5MB each.
# NOTE: gitignore has no trailing comments, only whole-line ones.
.kb/
*.mp4
__pycache__/

# Generated hero footage. Regenerate with veo.py or img.py; the prompts that
# produce them are in _heroes/*.txt and PROMPTS.md, and those ARE tracked.
_heroes/*.mp4
